  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fund support to UNESCO for the education sector in Ukraine</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till UNESCO-fond f&#xf6;r utbildningssektorn i Ukraina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fund support to UNESCO for the education sector in Ukraine. The Fund shall contribute to restoration of destroyed infrastructure with a special focus on shelters in pre-schools in order to enable pupils to continue their education.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till UNESCO-fond f&#xf6;r utbildningssektorn i Ukraina. Fonden ska bidra till restaurering av f&#xf6;rst&#xf6;rd infrastruktur med s&#xe4;rskilt fokus p&#xe5; skyddsrum i f&#xf6;rskolor f&#xf6;r att m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra fortsatt utbildning f&#xf6;r eleverna.</narrative>
  </description>
